	(text "Audio\nNS4150B x2 from VBAT_SW, outputs bridged (BTL): no speaker wire to GND, no shared return.\nInputs: the module's differential speaker outputs (SPOL/SPOR) through 100n + 100k per leg;\n  gain = 240k / Rin = 2.4 (raise it in the codec, or lower Rin to 47k for 5.1).\nCTRL = AMP_EN (GPIO21, high = on); R421 keeps the amps off while the ESP32 boots.\nSupply: 10u + 1u at each amp, C421 470u bulk next to them.\nHeadphones: HPOUTL/R through 47u (the codec's outputs sit at VREF), -3 dB ~ 100 Hz at 32 R.\nPJ-320D pinout (1 sleeve, 4 tip, 3 ring, 2 detect) is from a third-party listing:\n  CHECK it against the part before ordering. HP_DET pull-up is on the MCU sheet (R103)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
